  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1000 young Kenyans engaged in wellbeing activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Today in Kenya young people face unprecedented challenges - no jobs even with a college education, parental and school pressure, bullying, loneliness, and other economic pressures - such as predatory loan sharks. We are losing our youth to drugs, violence, and more often now death by suicide.  Young people are lonely and disconnected. Green String supports cultural, emotional, wellbeing, &amp; peer support circles for young people 10-24 years old that is transforming their lives through connections.</narrative>
  </description>
